"<html> <head></head> <body>  <div class=\"teacherTabs\" id=\"teacherTabs\">    <div id=\"tabb5155992bc83f424897c9e03dcb488452\" data-show=\"1\" data-languageflag=\"zh\" class=\"teacher_Tab teacher_Tab_zh active\" style=\"display: flex;\">    <div class=\"tab_txt\">     基本信息    </div>    <div class=\"tab_showHide\" style=\"display:flex;\">     <i class=\"tab_show\" onclick=\"tabShow(this)\" style=\"display: block; background-color: rgb(31, 81, 163);\"></i><i class=\"tab_hide\" onclick=\"tabHide(this)\" style=\"display:none; background-color:#1F51A3;\"></i>    </div>   </div>   <div id=\"tabbe82694af368a481d9cce0244e27ccd5a\" data-show=\"1\" data-languageflag=\"zh\" class=\"teacher_Tab\" style=\"display: flex;\">    <div class=\"tab_txt\">     科学研究    </div>    <div class=\"tab_showHide\" style=\"display:flex;\">     <i class=\"tab_show\" onclick=\"tabShow(this)\" style=\"display: block; background-color: rgb(31, 81, 163);\"></i><i class=\"tab_hide\" onclick=\"tabHide(this)\" style=\"display:none; background-color:#1F51A3;\"></i>    </div>   </div>    <div id=\"tabb4758\" data-show=\"1\" data-languageflag=\"zh\" class=\"teacher_Tab teacher_Tab_zh\" style=\"display: flex;\">    <div class=\"tab_txt\">     学生培养    </div>    <div class=\"tab_showHide\" style=\"display:flex;\">     <i class=\"tab_show\" onclick=\"tabShow(this)\" style=\"display: block; background-color: rgb(31, 81, 163);\"></i><i class=\"tab_hide\" onclick=\"tabHide(this)\" style=\"display:none; background-color:#1F51A3;\"></i>    </div>   </div>    <div class=\"teacher_TabAdd guideBorder\" style=\"display: flex; background-color: rgb(31, 81, 163);\"></div>   </div>   <div class=\"tacherContent\" style=\"\">    <div class=\"addBtn\" style=\"display: flex;\"> <span class=\"iconAdd\"></span> 新建主栏目    </div>    <div class=\"tacherContentParts\" style=\"\">     <div id=\"tabb5155992bc83f424897c9e03dcb488452part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: block;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">个人简介</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"1bf9e335a3ef45c7b10b6611fe79e3d0\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"870d2070a3e74a98af5f47ca5a3b5d9d\">           <p style=\"text-indent: 0em; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">高会军，男，1976年出生，中共党员，哈尔滨工业大学航天学院教授、博导，智能控制与系统研究所所长。国家杰青获得者（2008年）、国家高层次人才计划入选者（特聘教授2012年）、欧洲科学院外籍院士（2021年）、IEEE Fellow（2014年）、香港大学荣誉教授；曾任全国青联常委、黑龙江省青联副主席。在Nature/Science子刊、IEEE汇刊发表论文200余篇，谷歌学术引用6万余次（SCI他引3.5万余次），H指数141，11次入选ESI全球高被引科学家，出版英文专著7部，获授权国内外发明专利150项，授权IEEE国际标准2项。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent: 0em; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑; font-size:18px;\"><br></span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">获国家自然科学二等奖2项（排1和5）、国家技术发明二等奖1项（排1）、获何梁何利科学与技术创新奖、中国专利金奖、省部级及学会科学技术特等奖1项和一等奖6项、陈嘉庚青年科学奖、中国青年科技奖、科学探索奖、全国先进工作者、中国青年五四奖章等荣誉。任中国自动化学会副理事长、IEEE工业电子学会候任主席、《IEEE系统、人与控制论汇刊：系统》主编、《IEEE/ASME机电一体化汇刊》主编；获IEEE尤金·米特尔曼成就奖、IEEE诺伯特·维纳奖等国际重要奖项。主持国家自然科学基金创新研究群体、国家重点研发计划等项目。培养10余名学生入选国家级人才计划、优博。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent: 32px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></span></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">教育经历</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"f49f12d09a814e0d9b5a63aa7454a259\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"afc4a45c7f114718a9d9628390149fa0\">           <table border=\"0\">            <tbody>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">2001.03—2005.07</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">博士</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">1998.09—2001.03</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">沈阳工业大学</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">硕士</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">1995.07—1997.12</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">全国高等教育自学考试</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">本科</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">1991.09—1995.07</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">陕西第一工业学校</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">中专</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">2005.09—2007.10</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">加拿大Alberta大学</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">Postdoctoral Fellow</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">2003.11—2004.08</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">香港大学</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">Research Associate</td>             </tr>            </tbody>           </table>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">工作经历</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"c2bba6daf29e4447abbcb05317182e6d\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"1a2e1d00ff2a470fbf2f48e0dcfb0276\">           <table border=\"0\">            <tbody>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">2022.01—至今</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学控制科学与工程学科</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">学位委员会主席</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">2019.04—2021.05</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学交叉科学研究中心</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">主任</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">2015.09—2019.03</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学理学院</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">院长</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">2014.01—2015.09</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学人才工作办公室</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">主任</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">2010.07—至今</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学智能控制与系统研究所</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">所长</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">2005.08—至今</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学航天学院</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">教授</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td width=\"210\" style=\"width:210px; padding:2px 20px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">2004.11—2005.08</td>              <td width=\"330\" style=\"width:330px; padding:2px 10px 2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学航天学院</td>              <td width=\"220\" style=\"width:220px; padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">讲师</td>             </tr>            </tbody>           </table>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">荣誉奖励</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"d47665624583484d8502043c080c9850\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"b8582f71501a4d23b7bfec7cbcc912b3\">           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体; color:red;\">☆</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体; color:red;\">人才荣誉</span></strong></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2017年 国家级高层次人才（科技创新领军人才）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2015年 全国先进工作者</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2013年 国务院政府特殊津贴</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2012年 国家级高层次人才（特聘教授）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2011年 中国青年五四奖章</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2010年 新世纪百千万人才工程国家级人选</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2008年 国家杰青</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2007年 全国百篇优秀博士学位论文</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2005年 教育部新世纪优秀人才支持计划</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; color:red;\">☆国际</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; color:red;\">荣誉</span></strong></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2026年 国际自动控制联合会（IFAC）Outstanding Service Award</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2014年-2026年 全球高被引学者</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2024年 IEEE Trans. Cybernetics杰出论文奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2023年 IEEE诺伯特·维纳奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2023年 IEEE Trans. Industrial Electronics杰出论文奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2022年 IEEE尤金·米特尔曼成就奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2022年 日本永守奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2021年 欧洲科学院外籍院士</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2016年 IEEE Trans. Neural Networks and Learning Systems杰出论文奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2014年 IEEE Fellow</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2013年 IEEE工业电子学会J. David Irwin青年事业奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2005年 Dorothy J. Killam Memorial Postdoctoral Fellow Prize</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2005年 Honorary Walton Killam Memorial Postdoctoral Fellowship</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2005年 Alberta Ingenuity Fellowship</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; color:red;\">☆科技奖励</span></strong></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2026年 中国智能制造十大科技进展</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2026年 国家技术发明二等奖（排1）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2025年 何梁何利科学与技术创新奖（产业创新奖）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2025年 教育部科学研究优秀成果奖（工程技术）一等奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2024年 中国专利金奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2024年 中国自动化学会科技进步特等奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2021年 科学探索奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2014年 国家自然科学二等奖（排1）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2012年 陈嘉庚青年科学奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2011年 中国青年科技奖</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2008年 国家自然科学二等奖（排5）</span></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">学术兼职</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"9aa9c3c5373846788b916ed5491ade09\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"23337dafff64450e96453e45746662ea\">           <p style=\"margin-left: 28px; line-height: 120%; text-align: left; text-indent: 0em;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; color:red;\">☆组织兼职</span></strong></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● IEEE工业电子学会候任主席（2026-2027）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● 中国自动化学会副理事长（2025-2030）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● 中国仪器仪表学会理事（2025-2030）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● 国际自动控制联合会（IFAC）出版委员会副主席（2023-2029）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● 国际自动控制联合会（IFAC）理事会成员（2017-2023）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\"><br></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; color:red;\">☆期刊兼职</span></strong></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● IEEE Trans. Systems, Man, and Cybernetics: Systems主编（2026-2028）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● IEEE/ASME Trans. Mechatronics主编（2023-2025）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● IEEE Trans. Industrial Electronics共同主编（2014-2020）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● Automatica编委（2010-至今）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● IEEE Trans. Industrial Informatics编委（2013-至今）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\">● IEEE Trans. Cybernetics编委（2006-至今）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px;\"><br></span><br></p>           <p style=\"margin-left: 28px; line-height: 120%; text-align: left; text-indent: 0em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"></span><br></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tabb4758part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">招生信息</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"878bd9773fe54145b27e65bef6d94eba\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"2abd3e4b087845e3b90664d760702e07\">           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; color:red;\">☆博士招生</span></strong></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size:18px;\">● </span>招生学科：控制科学与工程、机械工程、集成电路</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size:18px;\">● 招生类别：直接攻博、硕博连读、申请考核</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size:18px;\">● 培养理念：注重综合素质培养，学术水平与实践能力共同培养；围绕国际前沿热点方向，开展前沿研究工作，并预期在Nature/Science及其子刊、IEEE汇刊等国际高水平期刊发表论文</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size:18px;\">● 名额较为充足，欢迎具有控制、机械、数学、电气、计算机、生物医学工程等专业背景的硕士、本科生联系</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size:18px;\"><br></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; color:red;\">☆硕士招生</span></strong></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; color:red;\"></span></strong></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">● 招生学科：控制科学与工程、机械工程、集成电路</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">● 招生类别：推荐免试、考研</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">● 培养理念：依据学生兴趣和规划分类培养，对于计划读博的学生，注重学术水平与实践能力共同培养，提升科研能力；对于毕业工作的学生，依托国家级重要项目，在机器人智能系统、光机电一体化等方向重点培养</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">● 名额较为充足，欢迎具有自动化、机械、数学、电气、计算机等专业背景的本科生联系</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">人才培养</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"9fd22fe0d992413380ca876e3ec792dc\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"a7249bb15d65446daa795538f78b97de\">           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; color:rgb(34, 34, 34);\">● </span>培养</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">12</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">名学生入选国家级高层次人才、国家杰青等国家级人才计划</span></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; color:rgb(34, 34, 34);\">● 培养22名学生获全国百篇优博、国家一级学会优博、哈工大优博</span></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px; color:rgb(34, 34, 34);\">● 培养30余名学生在普渡大学、帝国理工、上海交通大学、浙江大学等国内外高校就职</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px; color:rgb(34, 34, 34);\">● 培养50余名学生在各军工集团、华为、大疆、百度、谷歌等国内外知名企业就职</span></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tabbe82694af368a481d9cce0244e27ccd5apart\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">研究方向</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"ea2e3594c3914d909eae54291da8e7e2\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"82a2ac1356db40609b00d316452ba0d9\">           <p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:20px; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><strong>1. 智能控制理论与方法</strong></span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px; text-indent:2em;\">聚焦复杂动态系统建模与高性能控制理论研究，围绕网络化控制、多智能体协同控制、鲁棒与智能控制、高精度运动控制等开展研究，攻克通信约束、外部扰动、参数不确定等难题，为工业装备、智能仪器的高精度、强鲁棒稳定运行提供理论支撑与技术方案。</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:20px; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><strong>2. 具身智能与机器人系统</strong></span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px; text-indent:2em;\">面向显微操作机器人、飞行机器人、协作机械臂等智能机器人平台，围绕多模态视觉伺服、具身智能感知与决策、强化学习、深度学习等核心理论与技术开展研究，攻克机器人动态环境自适应、自主作业与智能控制难题，构建高性能、高适应性的机器人智能系统。</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:20px; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><strong>3. 精密电子制造高端装备</strong></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:120%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体; text-indent:28px;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px; text-indent:2em;\">面向高端电子制造装备的智能化、国产化发展需求，围绕高速高精度运动控制、精密视觉检测、多轴协同与系统优化、智能无人工厂等关键技术开展研究，形成高端制造装备技术体系，实现以高速高精度表面贴装装备为代表的高端电子制造装备国产自主可控。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:20px; color:rgb(192, 0, 0);\"><strong>4. 类器官与医学智能系统</strong></span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px; text-indent:2em;\">向生命科学与精准医疗发展需求，围绕智能显微操控、类器官原位测量与融合感知、类器官再生跨尺度调控等核心内容开展研究，研制类器官高通量标准化制造显微操控仪器，实现脑、心等30余种类器官高通量标准化制造，创建体外生物模型制造与诊疗新途径。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">代表性论文</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"b6bf06948d064a8f87bfd2e286050004\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"d8c9624ceeb844abb0d3ed8ce93a5bf9\">           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[01] Huang G, Zhang Z, Zhuang S, Yu X, Wu Y, Li Z, Liu Z, Tong M*, Zhang L*, <strong>Gao H*</strong>. Embodied Intelligence Enables Agentic Automation in Microscopy. <em><strong>Nature Methods</strong></em>. 2026, Accepted.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[02] Sun Y, Zhu A, Ji X, Li Y, Zhao J, Wang Y, Zhang L*, <strong>Gao H*</strong>, Yang L*. Minute-scale training for microrobot navigation. <em><strong>Nature Machine Intelligence</strong></em>, 2026, 8(10).</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[03] Wu Y, Huang G, Zhuang S, Yu X, Jia W, Liu Z, Li Z, Tong M*, Zhang L*, <strong>Gao H*</strong>. Fluid-driven robotic micromanipulation for assembloid fabrication. <em><strong>Science Advances</strong></em>, 2026, 12(44): eaei8832.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[04] Tong M, Huang G, Zhuang S, Yu X, Hu D, Lin W, Wu Y, Chen Y, Cheng S, Jiang M*, Zhang L*, <strong>Gao H*</strong>. Robotic micromanipulation for patterned and complex organoid biofabrication. <span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\"><em><strong>Science Advances</strong></em></span>, 2025, 11(36): eadz0808.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[05] Huang G, Chen Y, Wu Y, Zhuang S, Tong M, <strong>Gao H*</strong>. Patterned assembly of multibiological robots with global input. <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Robotic</strong></em>s, 2026, 42: 1290-1308.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[06] <strong>Gao H*</strong>, Chen T, Lam J. A new delay system approach to network-based control. <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 2008, 44(1): 39-52.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[07] <strong>Gao H*</strong>, Chen T. H∞ estimation for uncertain systems with limited communication capacity. <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic control</strong></em>, 2007, 52(11): 2070-2084.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[08] Hou J, <strong>Gao H*</strong>, Li X. DSets-DBSCAN: A Parameter-Free Clustering Algorithm. <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Image Processing</strong></em>, 2016, 25(7): 3182-3193.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[09] <strong>Gao H*</strong>, Li Z, Yu X, Qiu J. Hierarchical multiobjective heuristic for PCB assembly optimization in a beam-head surface mounter. <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</strong></em>, 2021, 52(7): 6911-6924.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[10]<strong> Gao H*</strong>, Wang C. A delay-dependent approach to robust H∞ filtering for uncertain discrete-time state-delayed systems. <em><strong>IEEETransactions on Signal Processing</strong></em>, 2004, 52(6): 1631-1640.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[11] <strong>Gao H*</strong>, Liu Y, Sun W, Yu X. Adaptive Wavelet Tracking Control of Dual-Linear-Motor-Driven Gantry Stage with Suppression of Crossbeam Rotation. <em><strong>IEEE/ASME Transactions on Mechatronics</strong></em>, 2024, 29(1): 97-105.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[12] <strong>Gao H*</strong>, Yi M, Yu J, Li J, Yu X. Character Segmentation-Based Coarse-Fine Approach for Automobile Dashboard Detection. <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics</strong></em>, 2019, 15(10): 5413-5424.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[13] <strong>Gao H*</strong>, Xue S, Yin S, Qiu J, Wang C. Output Feedback Control of Multirate Sampled-Data Systems with Frequency Specifications. <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Control Systems Technology</strong></em>, 2017, 25(5): 1599-1608.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[14] <strong>Gao H*</strong>, Jin W, Yang X, Kaynak O. A Line-Based-Clustering Approach for Ball Grid Array Component Inspection in Surface-Mount Technology. <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Industrial Electronics</strong></em>, 2017, 64(4): 3030-3038.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: timesNewRoman;\">[15] <strong>Gao H*</strong>, Chen T. Stabilization of nonlinear systems under variable sampling: a fuzzy control approach. <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Fuzzy Systems</strong></em>, 2007, 15(5): 972-983.</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>    </div>   </div> </body></html>"